    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^663300Lowen, of the 2nd squad, returned to her detachment 3 days after the incident. A trial was held, and she was judged guilty of fleeing when ordered to fight.^000000",
      "translation" : "^663300第二小隊的洛文在事件發生3天后回到了所屬分隊。她接受了審判，並被判定在奉命作戰時臨陣脫逃。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Personnel Record]",
      "translation" : "[人事檔案]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^663300Despite the severity of this offense, she was only discharged from the Crusaders and the holy power granted to her was forcibly removed...^000000",
      "translation" : "^663300儘管罪行嚴重，她卻只被十字軍除名，身上被授予的神聖力量也遭到強行剝奪...^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "She was forced to leave the Crusaders?! That's ridiculous!",
      "translation" : "她竟然被迫離開十字軍？！太荒唐了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}]",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Personnel Record",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Did they want to sentence her to death or what? That's almost too cruel. She must have been humiliated...",
      "translation" : "他們是想判她死刑嗎？這也太殘酷了。她一定受盡了屈辱..."
